===============================================================================

OutboxRelay has been installed! 🎉

Next steps:

1. Run migrations:
   rails db:migrate

2. Configure your topics and consumer groups in config/outbox_consumers.yml
   - Define topics with partition counts
   - Configure consumer groups with their consumer classes

3. Create consumer classes that inherit from OutboxRelay::OutboxConsumer:

   class MyConsumer < OutboxRelay::OutboxConsumer
     def initialize(partition_key:)
       super(
         consumer_group: "my_group",
         topic: "my_topic",
         partition_key: partition_key
       )
     end

     def consume_message(event)
       # Process event
     end
   end

4. Start OutboxRelay:
   ./bin/outbox_relay

   Or with options:
   ./bin/outbox_relay --polling-interval 0.5 --batch-size 200

   For help:
   ./bin/outbox_relay help

5. Monitor status:
   bundle exec rake outbox_relay:status
   bundle exec rake outbox_relay:lag

For more information, see: https://github.com/splash-brands/outbox-relay

===============================================================================
